name: Erratic Clubs Spike — many Clubs
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erratic Deck starting deck with at least 20 Clubs, a suit spike for Flush lines,
  Gluttonous Joker, Onyx Agate, Seeing Double, and Smeared Joker pivots. RAG aliases:
  erratic clubs, all Clubs, club flush seed, black suit pile, weird suit spike.
deck: Erratic
stake: White
must:
  - erraticSuit: Clubs
    min: 20
should:
  - joker: OnyxAgate
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 55
  - joker: GluttonousJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: SeeingDouble
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: SmearedJoker
    label: "Combines Clubs and Spades into black-suit support"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
